  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Dancers are practitioners of the alluring art of dance. They have a flair for enlivening their audience and giving awe-inspiring shows.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Dancers</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Apsalar, Malazan Book of the Fallen</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Azura, Fire Emblem Fates</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Sandrilene fa Toren, The Circle Opens</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Dancer</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The dancer is a low-defense support with a focus on action efficiency. Grant Actions through Step Up, as your main offenses will occur when you Crit on Reflex Saves.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Step Up</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Midline</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Finesse, Performance</span></p>",
